PREVIOUSLY DEMONSTRATED — MULTI-CARTRIDGE MEMORY CONSOLIDATION
The physical consolidation of three independent memory cartridges into a single live 80-layer K/V memory has already been demonstrated on frozen Qwen2.5-72B-Instruct, including sequential cartridge mounting, exact SHA-256 integrity verification, and internal memory X-ray measurements.
For the implementation, experimental evidence, and multi-cartridge question-answering observations, see: Research Record III — Qwen2.5-72B, Direct Internal-State Injection · Zenodo Record 23434686 · https://zenodo.org/records/23434686
(Previously published research — not a result of this experiment.)

